      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Utah Specific Cost Drivers"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Regional Climate & Structural Additions: In high-elevation areas like Park City or Summit County, prices can sit on the higher end ($200 to $600 ) because inspectors must account for specialized issues like severe freeze-thaw cycles, structural ice dam damage, and heavy snow-load stress.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3,
              4
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Home Size and Complexity: Small, single-story homes with flat lines are cheaper to inspect, whereas large multi-level homes or homes with very steep pitches along the Wasatch Front command higher premiums due to the safety equipment required.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              4,
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Real Estate Add-ons: If you are buying a home, a standard general home inspection in Utah costs $300\u2013$500 but doesn't always include a deep roof review. Hiring a specialized roofing contractor to provide a certified standalone roof report usually starts at $500 .",
            "reference_indexes": [
              6
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "\ud83d\udca1 How to Get it for Free"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you suspect you have recent storm, wind, or hail damage, many local companies across Utah\u2014such as Olympus Cove Roofing in Salt Lake or Roof Monster in Layton\u2014offer complimentary, no-obligation visual inspections. They do this with the hope that if they find damage, you will hire them to complete the repair or work with your insurance provider on a replacement.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          7,
          8,
          9,
          10
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "To help narrow down your options, tell me:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Are you looking for a free estimate for a repair, or do you need a certified written report for a home sale or insurance claim?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "What city or region of Utah is the property located in?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Roughly how old is the roof, or are you experiencing any active leaks?"
          }
        ]
      }
